Third-party content

The units of measure in the namespace http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/ and the
quantity kind dimension vectors in http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/
that cask.ttl contains are taken from QUDT 3.5.3
(http://qudt.org/3.5.3/vocab/unit), Copyright QUDT.org, licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). They remain under that
license.

The material was modified: of everything QUDT states about a unit, only
qudt:conversionMultiplier, qudt:conversionOffset, qudt:hasDimensionVector,
qudt:iec61360Code, qudt:uneceCommonCode and the English rdfs:label are
reproduced, each verbatim, and the typing owl:NamedIndividual, which QUDT
leaves implicit, is added. tools/generate_units.py performs the extraction.

The MIT License above applies to the rest of this repository.
